7/19/26, 12:02 PM                                                              SOP-STG-003 - Disk Error Diagnosis and Repair

# **STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE**

## Disk Error Diagnosis and Repair via Chkdsk

| Document ID | SOP-STG-003                       | Version         | 1.0       |
| :---------- | :-------------------------------- | :-------------- | :-------- |
| Department  | IT Service Desk / L1 Tech Support | Effective Date  | July 2026 |

---

### 1. Objective

To identify and repair filesystem structure corruption, bad logical storage blocks, and read/write drive anomalies causing performance bottlenecks.

---

### 2. Scope

Applies to client storage assets (HDDs and SSDs) experiencing extreme latency or error warnings.

---

### 3. Pre-requisites & Warnings

> **CRITICAL WARNING:** Running a deep check disk scan requires a volume lock, forcing a system reboot. The analysis can take 30 minutes to over 2 hours. Always secure user authorization regarding operational downtime before scheduling.

---

### 4. Step-by-Step Procedure

#### 4.1 Open Command Prompt as Administrator

*   Launch an elevated Command Prompt session via the Windows Start Menu search interface.

